title The line that outran the sweeps -- ten picks, one push, and Mind cleared to fly
prompt kg on the round's close; mid-close Keaton asked for Dream's ww remote and transport, the ssh_config_urbit rename, and Dream commit sightings.
think The fleet's round-open stashes dirt and resets to xy/main unconditionally -- seven sweeps and three diverged resets in one afternoon. The winning move was the script's own grammar: commit and push before the next open, so the reset ADOPTS the line instead of parking it.
think git rev-list --right-only --cherry-pick 58974628c...caec5f9dd named the ten parked commits with no upstream equivalent; three landed and pushed first (the fold anointed), then seven more through two conflicts -- the day index merged by hand, the README taken from the pick and regenerated at close.
think The Mind loop control's two false reds were both mine: a stale elder pin after the MANY HANDS grant, then sh-instead-of-bash -- POSIX-mode bash persists a VAR=x prefix past a FUNCTION call, so the phase cases' MIND_RISHI_BIN leaked into the nested-git case after its wrapper was deleted. Under bash, GREEN whole.
think The roster's eight cold reds triaged: five were churn (green solo on a quiet tree), REDS over-bound took a six-row fold through reds_fold.sh, the card and SHRED_PREP were trimmed under their bounds, and ascii_comment is a real pre-existing dialect red -- this bench's awk counts an em-dash as three bytes where the control expects one character; xy carries pier/one-dialect-twelve-sites for the same class.
think Dream's transport repair ran on the Vultr pier by Keaton's hand: a fresh .git/ssh_config_jail written with HOME-relative paths, the jail deploy key copied into grain-dream/.ssh, core.sshCommand repointed, ww seated, fetch proven. The rename swept the six living citers here in the same close.
obs An unsent line is a proposal that loses every race by design. Push cadence beats verification cadence in a fleet checkout; the witnesses can sing after the push, and a fix-forward costs less than a fifth recovery.
obs A control run under the wrong shell is a different program. The shebang said bash; sh made one assignment immortal and three diagnoses wrong.
file construction/archive/REDS-meters-and-marks-rows-304-317.md six closed rows folded, spine witness GREEN
file construction/ITINERARY.md remerged under bound with ww and ssh_config_jail directives
file session-logs/date/README-index-20260828.md three orphaned rows restored
file tools/l/chatgpt-mind-rishi-adaptation.md the machine lane's two grants recorded
recommend check-in Mind restarts on Keaton's word -- sentinel cleared, clone at 41eaa0ade; the ascii dialect red and the hot-roster pass belong to the next lap
